Home Assistant weather icons: the HA_WEATHER_PATHS shapes in
../album-slideshow-card.js, adapted (moved into a lookup table) from
https://github.com/home-assistant/frontend/blob/a7eb10013206fc7e3dfafde3c79716b7d44f5f72/src/data/weather.ts
